  "description": "Test build of Karthus as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes 0.305.0): replaces the main pack's Karthus so Death Defied turns him into a spirit at a lethal blow for 7 seconds before he falls - as in League a dead man: banished the whole time (untargetable by champions, minions and towers, no health bar, rooted, never recalling), his ghost drawn where he fell, Lay Waste, Defile and Requiem cast for him; his respawn counts the spirit's time. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
